  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">For discussion of original edition, see: Book of 101 books, pages 174-177; Parr, M. Photobook, v. 1, pages 286-287; Kaneko, R. Japanese photobooks of the 1960s and '70s, pages 86-93.</subfield>
