  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="6">880-05</subfield>
    <subfield code="a">"Map / Kenzaburō Ōe" = "Map / Kenzaburo Ōe" (poem, in Japanese and English) on folded sheet inserted in volume. Sheet is light brown paper printed in black (Japanese) and dark brown (English).</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="6">880-06</subfield>
    <subfield code="a">"1965-nenban shashin-shū 'Chizu' sai fukkoku ni tsuite" / Kawada Kikuji = "On the re-reprint of 'Chizu' (1965) / Kikuji Kawada" (in Japanese, with English translation by Andreas Stuhlmann) on sheet inserted in chemise. Sheet is black paper printed in silver.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Volume contains 49 double-page and 23 quadruple-page photographic images on 190 pages; each quadruple-page image presented as gatefold on 2 folded leaves. At end of volume is a colophon leaf in English. Captions of the photographs in Japanese and English on inside of book jacket, printed in white on black; publication information for original edition in Japanese and English on back flap of book jacket, printed in tan on black. Physical presentation, including containers, reproduces that of the original edition.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="563" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Publisher's black paper boards, in photographically illustrated book jacket. Issued in an illustrated die-cut stiff black paper chemise, printed in white and light blue; enclosed in illustrated light brown corrugated cardboard slipcase, in stiff black paper sleeve. Binding, book jacket and containers reproduce presentation of original edition.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="546" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Text on inserted sheets, book jacket and containers in Japanese and English.</subfield>
  </datafield>
